# Counts instances of type kObject.
# Omnis creates copies of objects on incorrect referencing, which heavily hurt performance.
# This method can monitor that.
# Object references can be counted directly via $listrefs().$linecount

Calculate insts as 0
Do $libs.$sendall($ref.$classes.$sendall($ref.$insts.$sendall(insts.$assign(insts+1))))
Quit method insts